oracle GNU Make 4.4.1
outcome success
file first.mk kept 4
| # Prerequisites declared across the files accumulate on the one target, exactly
| # as they would if the two files had been concatenated.
| all: early
| early: ; @printf '%s\n' early >> out
file out touched 3
| late
| early
| done
file second.mk kept 2
| all: late ; @printf '%s\n' done >> out
| late: ; @printf '%s\n' late >> out
